[{"type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 18, "text": "ครั้งแรกที่เปิด Plane : จาก container ว่าง ๆ ถึง workspace แรก", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b2545"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 110, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "strokeColor": "#1864ab", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "1. docker compose up -d\nmigrator → api\n(register + configure)"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 110, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "2. เปิด localhost:8080\n\"Welcome to Plane\"\nGet started"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 520, "y": 110, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "3. /god-mode/\nSetup your Plane Instance\nสร้าง instance admin"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 760, "y": 110, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "4. /god-mode/general/\nตั้งค่า instance\n(ยังไม่ต้องแตะ)"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1000, "y": 110, "width": 170, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "5. กลับไป /\nsign in ด้วย email\n+ password"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 245, "y": 155, "width": 30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f1", "endElementId": "f2", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 485, "y": 155, "width": 30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f2", "endElementId": "f3", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 725, "y": 155, "width": 30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f3", "endElementId": "f4", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 965, "y": 155, "width": 30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f4", "endElementId": "f5", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"id": "f6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1000, "y": 260, "width": 170, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "6. Onboarding\nCreate your profile"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 760, "y": 260, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "7. Create your workspace\nname + slug\n(seed โปรเจกต์ตัวอย่างให้)"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "rectangle", "x": 520, "y": 260, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "8. Invite teammates\n→ \"I'll do it later\""}, {"id": "f9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 260, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "9. Home ของ workspace\nProjects → Add Project"}, {"id": "f10", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 260, "width": 200, "height": 90, "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "10. เปิดฟีเจอร์ Cycles\nModules · Views · Pages\n(Intake ปิดไว้ก่อน)"}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 1085, "y": 205, "width": 0, "height": 55, "startElementId": "f5", "endElementId": "f6", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 995, "y": 305, "width": -30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f6", "endElementId": "f7", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 755, "y": 305, "width": -30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f7", "endElementId": "f8", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 515, "y": 305, "width": -30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f8", "endElementId": "f9", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "arrow", "x": 275, "y": 305, "width": -30, "height": 0, "startElementId": "f9", "endElementId": "f10", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 400, "width": 1130, "height": 170, "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 412, "text": "ค่าที่ต้องรู้ (placeholder สำหรับ LAB เท่านั้น)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b7285"}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 445, "text": "อีเมล admin@example.com · รหัสผ่าน Plane@Lab2026! (ต้องผ่าน zxcvbn ≥ 3: ยาว ≥ 8 มีตัวใหญ่ เล็ก ตัวเลข อักขระพิเศษ)\nworkspace slug devtools-lab · โปรเจกต์ Plane Lab / identifier PLAB\nไม่ต้องมี SMTP: sign-up เปิดอยู่โดยปริยาย และคำเชิญใช้ปุ่ม Copy link ได้", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#16212f"}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 520, "text": "curl -s http://localhost:8080/api/instances/ | python3 -m json.tool | grep -E 'is_setup_done|enable_signup'", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f"}]